1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:04,650
Buah manggis konon bikin Ratu
Inggris rela bayar 100 pound...

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,120
padahal di sini,

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,520
dijual kiloan di pinggir jalan!

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,550
Katanya,

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,430
manggis selalu busuk
sebelum sampai London.

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,290
Tapi,

7
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:16,194
bukti sayembara itu
tak pernah ditemukan...

8
00:00:16,194 --> 00:00:19,980
kisahnya baru muncul 29
tahun setelah ratu wafat!

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,100
Yang tercatat:

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:24,453
tukang kebun Inggris membuahkan
manggis di rumah kaca...

11
00:00:24,453 --> 00:00:26,830
dan buahnya diganjar medali emas!

12
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:27,470
Follow,

13
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:29,810
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
